\"status\\\":\\\"SUSPECTED_GAP\\\",\\\"location\\\":\\\"prior-candidate.json, R001/S003-S004: localization and descent to the reduced module\\\",\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"The supplied proof route appears mathematically complete on review, but I have not completed the required independently authored, structurally valid NL0 artifact. The attempted artifact was rejected for an object-inventory defect, not for a mathematical defect. I therefore cannot honestly report completion or represent that failure as a substantive proof gap.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"The structural checker returned UNDECLARED-OBJECT for H004. That feedback is a representation defect. The completed proof's matrix-unit, rank-one lattice, and reduction steps have not yielded a judged substantive gap.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"Read all four frozen task documents and the requested Yui format, self-containment, stage, authoring, and submission-template rules. Independently reviewed the supplied proof route. Submitted a candidate to check_artifact; it was rejected with the specific H004 object-inventory error. No M/E sources are needed by the supplied route.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","p